@startuml kairos-member-views-notification-centre
title Member Views Notifications Centre

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open Notifications Centre
MemberApp -> API: GET /notifications
API -> DB: SELECT notifications WHERE user_id = member
DB --> API: rows
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {notifications}

MemberApp --> Member: Render notification list

Member -> MemberApp: Tap notification
MemberApp -> API: PATCH /notifications/{id}/read
API -> DB: UPDATE notification SET read=true
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

@enduml
